body = "Victim: Gregory Mason, 15. Stepson of the suspect.\n\nCause of death: asphyxiation. Strangulation marks on the neck. Toxicology clean.\n\nThe suspect's alibi is partially contradicted by footage from the garage camera.\n\nAnna's note: he is watching how I react. Don't rush. Keep a straight face."
